  "prefLabel": "Env-A 205.08 Compliance with Waiver Conditions",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 205.08 Compliance with Waiver Conditions.\n\n(a) Any person who receives a waiver shall comply with the conditions set forth therein and with all applicable sections of subtitle Env-A 100.\n\n(b) Failure to comply with the conditions of a waiver shall constitute grounds for reopening and revising the underlying permit as specified in Env-A 609 or Env-A 612, as applicable, or suspension or revocation of the underlying permit as specified in Env-A 613, as well as enforcement in accordance with the authority set forth in RSA 125-C:15.\n\nSource. #10187, eff 9-25-12; ss by #13491, eff 11-19-22\n\nAPPENDIX",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-a200.html"
